---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | RegPulse Regulatory Intelligence"
  description="Terms of Service governing access to RegPulse listing compliance scanners, bulk CSV catalog passes, and automated FDA Watchlist monitoring subscriptions."
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-teal-700">Legal &amp; Compliance</p>
        <h1 id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="mt-1 text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-950">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500">Effective Date: November 26, 2026 • Last Updated: November 27, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950">1. Service Scope &amp; Non-Legal-Advice Notice</h2>
        <p>
          RegPulse (“Service”) provides automated regulatory screening software, bulk CSV keyword/ingredient auditing, and automated monitoring of publicly available U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) Warning Letters, openFDA enforcement recalls, and 510(k) databases. <strong>RegPulse is an independent software provider and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the FDA, FTC, EPA, or Amazon.</strong> All outputs are informational compliance aids and do not constitute formal legal advice or attorney-client representation.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950">2. Plans, License Keys &amp; Fulfillment</h2>
        <p>
          During pilot onboarding (while self-serve card checkout completes Merchant of Record verification), plan and pilot requests are fulfilled via email with a unique License Key dispatched within 24 hours. Once self-serve checkout is enabled, completed purchases automatically generate and deliver License Keys via email. One-time Bulk Catalog Passes unlock 200-SKU CSV screening and remediation export, and recurring Watchlist Radar subscriptions provide self-serve access to the Alert Portal (<code>/alerts/</code>) and automated 12-hour FDA Warning Letter &amp; Recall notifications for the active period.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950">3. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p>
          You agree not to share paid License Keys publicly, attempt unauthorized access to RegPulse API endpoints, or use the Service to facilitate unlawful marketing of adulterated, tainted, or prohibited substances.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          Regulatory enforcement policies and marketplace moderation bots change frequently. RegPulse provides the Service on an “AS IS” basis and shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages, including marketplace listing suppressions or inventory holds. Maximum aggregate liability shall not exceed the fees paid by you to RegPulse in the preceding 3 months.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950">5. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions regarding these Terms may be directed to our compliance support desk at <a href="mailto:support@regpulsehq.com" class="text-teal-700 font-semibold underline">support@regpulsehq.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
